spell flag)\">HasHighGroundRangeExtension</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/HasSomaticComponent_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasSomaticComponent (spell flag)\">HasSomaticComponent</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:\n<a href=\"/wiki/Bernard\" title=\"Bernard\">Bernard</a>\n</p>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715062349\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.063 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.066 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2693/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 50272/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 16694/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 24/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 34/1000\nLua time usage: 0.016/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1210954/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   53.815      1 -total\n 99.30%   53.437      1 Template:Feature_page\n 91.93%   49.473     47 Template:Trim\n 24.64%   13.262      1 Template:Feature_page/technical_section\n 18.35%    9.873      6 Template:Icon_text\n 12.36%    6.650      1 Template:Main_namespace_only\n 11.36%    6.113      2 Template:Hidden_code\n  9.59%    5.160      2 Template:Icon_link\n  8.43%    4.538      1 Template:PageSeo\n  6.51%    3.502      1 Template:Template_style\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:30782-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715062349 and revision id 395111. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}